                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Best suited to</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-green-400">Home shops, serious DIY, filling gaps</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-green-400">Full-time professionals</td>
